Author: `claude-opus-5-5` (Claude Opus 5.5), O'Connor 1.3.0 seat, same-author repair, 2026-10-11. Brief: `REPAIR-BRIEF.md`. Baseline for diff: `state/movement-002/pre-repair-r1/`.

Method: chapters 9, 10, 12 and 13 were re-read from disk first, with the coordinator's twelve line fixes in place; none was undone. No file under `books/` was opened, read or searched. No git command was run. Every change is a hand-written replacement of an exact passage; no script split or joined sentences at punctuation. Nothing was declined.

**After repair:** 36,978 words (baseline 36,754; +224) · gates 0 / 0 / 0 on all seven chapters · overlap **0 unprotected**, 15 protected · sentence mean 13.70 · ≤5 words 29.0% · ≥40 words 4.1% · paragraph median 20 · 999.4 words per scene.

