   113	Positions, catalogued as he took his own: Karis on the bar, its middle, knife in her right hand and a river stone the size of two fists in her left. Lira at the bar's upstream end, ten paces from Karis, the long knife low. Brom on his stone in the near channel, four paces short of the bar's near end, the current on his left, the bill-hook on its short haft in his right, the road behind him. Cael on the near shingle at the water's edge, twelve paces downstream of where the road went in, nothing in his hands yet and everything in him held. The far channel empty. The pools flat and dark. Seln nowhere he could see.
