   252	
   253	*Seln did the shadow work tonight. I didn't. Out here there's a ledger and a ferry west once a month, and a defector's tradecraft in my hands would tell anyone who reads carefully where I learned it. The seal holds. Different country, same arithmetic.*
   254	
   255	*The bowman says none of us shouted. I'm putting it beside the carter's sentence, and I notice there's beginning to be a shelf.*
   256	
   257	---
