   268	
   269	*Stillhound pack, Thornwater ford: cleared. Five confirmed. Crew of five, four injured, none lost. Price paid.*
   270	
   271	He read it three times. He copied it into the log, verbatim, under the entry with the injuries in it, and then sat a while with the pen not moving, in a loft that smelled of grain, with three people below him who could not hold a pen or walk or use an arm, and one who could, and wrote the one line under it that there was.
   272	
   273	*First honest number anyone's written about us in a year. It says four of five got hurt. It's right.*

